:" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"title":"Interaction_DragView","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}]}}}